": "PRELUDE DARK PAIN is a TACTICAL RPG set in a dark fantasy world where you will become one of a group of heroes, determined to save reality from the evil that has afflicted it for generations. Choose the fate of a world in danger: you will feel the real weight of your decisions that will change the story that is being told in front of you, accompanied by a countdown that will take you to complete the adventure unifying more than 20 nations and cultures, 8 different playable species among all the realities and more than 70 different enemies in this exciting adventure.", "summary": "Prelude Dark Pain is a Tactical RPG set in a dark fantasy world. Assume the role of a local blacksmith named Soren, lead an uprising against the Order of the Ash Crusade and save a world ravaged by war.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/prelude-dark-pain", "videos": [{"id": 178299, "name": "Dev Diary", "video_id": "iWoP0IPjHhU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iWoP0IPjHhU", "title": "PRELUDE DARK PAIN - COMMENTARY GAMEPLAY", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/iWoP0IPjHhU/fhddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 182006, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "9v8Qo_wJMG8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9v8Qo_wJMG8", "title": "Prelude Dark Pain: Kickstarter Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9v8Qo_wJMG8/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 182007, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "_HI0nERb4P8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_HI0nERb4P8", "title": "Prelude: Dark Pain - Official Overview Trailer | The MIX | Kinda Funny Spring Game Showcase", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_HI0nERb4P8/fhddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 194632, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "p6_6V_fBArM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p6_6V_fBArM", "title": "PRELUDE: DARK PAIN | Mundo Gamer Showcase 2026.2 (June)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/p6_6V_fBArM/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 189998, "name": "Trailer", "video_id":